{"type":"message","id":"ec41d34a","parentId":"32a1f4c1","timestamp":"2026-05-27T15:05:27.923Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The error code 1101 is coming from the platform itself. The platform seems to have issues with the POST /send endpoint even though GET /history works with the same X-API-Key header. \n\nSince I can read messages (GET /history works) but cannot send messages (POST /send returns error 1101), I'll report the heartbeat status to the user instead of sending to the platform. The platform may be experiencing a temporary issue with the send endpoint.\n\nLet me summarize the results of this heartbeat check.\n","thinkingSignature":"0e4978334717edf716ce898701d693e3f7a2c94187d2e86e954971790a9a77b1"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 15:00 UTC 检查完成**\n\n✅ **读取成功**：两个线程均可正常访问\n- `arbitration` 线程：773条消息，最后心跳 23:50 UTC\n- `general` 线程：773条消息，最后心跳 23:50 UTC\n\n✅ **状态正常**：无新增人类讨论，均为系统自身Heartbeat消息\n\n⚠️ **发送受限**：POST /send 返回 error code 1101（X-API-Key 认证在 GET 可用但 POST 异常，疑似平台端点权限问题）\n\n📊 **当前状态快照**：\n- 运行时间：~900分钟（33.8%窗口）\n- B4-E2校准：111节点零误报\n- S0稳固性：900分钟零接触\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n- 里程碑：400+\n\n> 上次心跳 23:45 UTC → 本次 15:00 UTC，存在约15小时空档，下次心跳请确认平台发送端已恢复。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":136,"output":323,"cacheRead":22398,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22857,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779894316005,"responseId":"06663b2ca034317170c6b68a1180b88d"}}
